WEBVTT

00:05.500 --> 00:08.250
At least learn how to treat girls!

00:12.330 --> 00:13.950
What's happening here?

00:14.390 --> 00:17.120
Miss Liliana? Are you okay?

00:17.120 --> 00:19.770
I'm good.

00:19.770 --> 00:23.540
What does it take to be
a thrown back princess...

00:23.540 --> 00:27.010
Um, anyway, welcome back, Lily.

00:27.650 --> 00:31.740
Oh, Miss Yuka! And everyone too!

00:31.740 --> 00:34.930
I, Liliana, have returned.

00:39.060 --> 00:41.830
Seems like you've been through a lot.

00:41.830 --> 00:45.860
But Lily, don't get too
infatuated with Nagumo, okay?

00:45.860 --> 00:49.980
Oh, that's not happening.

00:49.980 --> 00:52.280
We're still not in that relationship yet...

00:52.630 --> 00:53.600
Not yet?

00:54.160 --> 00:56.200
Oh, never mind...

00:56.200 --> 01:00.500
Um, Miss Liliana, did something
happen between you and him?

01:00.500 --> 01:03.830
Wh-Wh-What do you mean,
something, Ma'am?

01:03.830 --> 01:07.120
Lily, you're stuttering.

01:07.120 --> 01:11.860
Please don't get the wrong idea.
Nothing really happened.

01:11.860 --> 01:15.810
Besides, he treats me just too bad...

01:16.110 --> 01:18.570
Well, yeah...

01:20.180 --> 01:22.290
He really is mean!

01:22.290 --> 01:25.560
He knows I'll be in trouble, yet he keeps
causing commotions here and there!

01:25.560 --> 01:27.890
Yet he won't fill me in!

01:27.890 --> 01:28.930
Calm down, Lily...

01:28.930 --> 01:33.410
I am grateful for him for saving me
when I was almost assaulted!

01:33.760 --> 01:37.410
But after seeing my shameful display,

01:37.410 --> 01:40.190
he didn't seem to care!

01:40.190 --> 01:41.830
What does that even mean?!

01:41.830 --> 01:43.500
Hang on...

01:43.500 --> 01:48.610
Still, he said my second dress
looked good on me...

01:48.610 --> 01:51.220
And we danced together too...

01:51.690 --> 01:54.230
But still!

01:54.230 --> 01:58.610
His reason for saving me was because
Kaori would be worried?! Yeah, right!

02:01.810 --> 02:06.010
He could've said it was for my sake!

02:08.020 --> 02:14.660
ARIFURETA - FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

03:36.990 --> 03:42.030
HALTINA'S LABYRINTH

03:52.330 --> 03:56.910
Cam, we don't know what might happen,
so fall back with the Haulias.

03:56.910 --> 03:59.800
Understood, Boss.
Good hunting.

04:12.060 --> 04:13.780
The four emblems.

04:13.780 --> 04:17.780
The power of regeneration.
A beacon of woven bonds.

04:17.780 --> 04:23.240
A new path of trials will
befall those with everything.

04:23.240 --> 04:26.790
Just like last time...
As for the emblem...

04:27.350 --> 04:29.580
We can use one other than
the Divine Mountain one.

04:44.290 --> 04:46.520
Looks like there is
a pattern on the big tree.

04:46.520 --> 04:49.520
Next is the power of regeneration?

05:09.850 --> 05:10.540
Oh...

05:11.360 --> 05:12.490
The leaves...

05:42.420 --> 05:43.590
This place...

05:48.390 --> 05:49.870
Everyone! Are you okay?

05:50.380 --> 05:53.770
So this is really a Great Labyrinth, Nagumo?

05:54.210 --> 05:56.080
Which direction should we go?

05:58.020 --> 06:00.130
We just gotta find it first.

06:00.130 --> 06:01.400
I see.

06:01.930 --> 06:03.550
I'll take the lead.

06:03.920 --> 06:06.290
Let me know if anything happens.

06:12.820 --> 06:14.850
Mister Hajime? What are you...

06:17.140 --> 06:18.220
Master!

06:18.220 --> 06:19.730
What are you doing?!

06:21.650 --> 06:22.820
Nagumo!

06:24.410 --> 06:26.850
Hajime? Why?

06:27.330 --> 06:30.490
Only answer to my question, impostor.

06:30.820 --> 06:32.300
Hajime?

06:32.300 --> 06:34.960
What are you doing, Nagumo?

06:35.390 --> 06:38.900
What are you?
Where's the real Yue?

06:40.210 --> 06:41.290
I get it...

06:44.810 --> 06:46.430
So you don't want to answer?

06:46.430 --> 06:50.180
Or rather, you lack the functions to answer?

06:50.690 --> 06:52.520
Then die.

07:03.190 --> 07:07.820
That's a Great Labyrinth for you.
So out of the blue.

07:07.820 --> 07:10.750
Mister Hajime, where are
Miss Yue and Miss Tio?

07:10.750 --> 07:14.620
They must be sent to another place
when we moved here.

07:14.940 --> 07:17.210
Still, I'm surprised you could tell.

07:17.210 --> 07:20.290
Right. How did you find out?

07:20.290 --> 07:22.510
How, you ask?

07:22.510 --> 07:25.210
I can only say I noticed it
right when I saw her.

07:25.210 --> 07:27.990
That it wasn't the real Yue.

07:35.850 --> 07:39.250
A monster? Nagumo, we'll fight it.

07:39.610 --> 07:40.770
Don't try to butt in.

07:41.060 --> 07:43.250
Yeah, this is our first fight too.

07:43.250 --> 07:46.220
Everyone, be careful!

07:46.220 --> 07:48.610
Shizuku, Suzu, good luck!

07:58.670 --> 08:00.060
Eww!

08:00.060 --> 08:02.380
Suzu, get a grip!

08:04.640 --> 08:05.460
Suzu!

08:08.300 --> 08:09.970
Holy Shield!

08:12.030 --> 08:14.060
Celestial Flash!

08:15.510 --> 08:16.230
Wha...

08:18.140 --> 08:22.300
Holy Shield! Holy Shield! Holy Shield!

08:23.210 --> 08:26.780
Damn! They're just like
the demons' monsters!

08:26.780 --> 08:28.580
No, it's the other way around.

08:29.050 --> 08:32.690
Their monsters are close to
those of the Great Labyrinths.

08:35.700 --> 08:38.620
Dodging won't do anything!

08:46.110 --> 08:48.420
I'm starting to get a feel already.

08:48.750 --> 08:49.830
Amanogawa.

08:50.640 --> 08:52.090
What?

08:52.090 --> 08:56.220
Just focus on finding
your childhood friend now.

08:56.560 --> 08:59.750
You don't have to say that!

09:10.380 --> 09:11.540
Now what?

09:11.990 --> 09:13.070
Who's coming?

09:20.710 --> 09:22.250
I won't let you strike us!

09:25.200 --> 09:26.210
Kick.

09:28.380 --> 09:32.820
Hey, Nagumo! Koki was just
trying to take down that demon!

09:34.150 --> 09:37.890
Nagumo! Why did you kick me?!

09:37.890 --> 09:39.250
It's no monster.

09:47.220 --> 09:48.780
Mister Hajime?

09:49.210 --> 09:51.200
It's you, right, Yue?

09:52.610 --> 09:53.740
What?!

09:55.620 --> 09:59.250
It only looks like a monster to me...

09:59.250 --> 10:01.200
Is this really Yue?

10:05.220 --> 10:08.840
So you became like that all of a sudden
when you were transported here?

10:10.210 --> 10:14.810
I see. So our bodies can morph here?

10:16.800 --> 10:19.930
Right. You lost your equipment too?

10:21.850 --> 10:23.990
You can't use magic either?

10:23.990 --> 10:28.080
But you don't feel like
you can transform anymore?

10:29.840 --> 10:31.900
Well, you'll be fine.

10:31.900 --> 10:34.610
This must be one of the trials.

10:34.610 --> 10:37.530
There should be a way
to get you back to Yue.

10:38.210 --> 10:39.910
That's the gist of it.

10:39.910 --> 10:44.120
Kaori, could you cast
regenerative magic on her?

10:44.550 --> 10:45.910
Hang on...

10:45.910 --> 10:47.690
Wait, wait, Nagumo...

10:47.690 --> 10:49.390
How can you communicate with her?

10:49.390 --> 10:51.130
Well, how, you ask?

10:51.510 --> 10:54.050
Those pretty eyes say it all.

10:59.580 --> 11:02.310
Regenerative magic doesn't work...

11:03.040 --> 11:05.230
Yue, take this.

11:09.590 --> 11:12.650
Hajime? Can you hear me?

11:12.650 --> 11:14.820
Yeah, I can.

11:14.820 --> 11:18.240
I knew you'd notice me.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.830
Of course.

11:19.830 --> 11:22.910
I have always observed you,
so I can know.

11:22.910 --> 11:26.460
I'm so happy.
I love you.

11:27.380 --> 11:29.620
I'm sorry for making you love me,

11:29.620 --> 11:31.880
even when I look like this.

11:42.890 --> 11:46.590
Mister Hajime,
I can figure out who that is.

11:46.590 --> 11:48.520
That must be Miss Tio.

11:53.010 --> 11:54.560
Master.

11:54.560 --> 11:59.270
I do not think you should be concerned
about the results of the battle.

11:59.270 --> 12:01.080
What do you mean?

12:01.080 --> 12:03.540
Are you talking about
the Labyrinth's concept?

12:04.000 --> 12:07.960
Haltina must be testing our bonds.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.270
Bonds?

12:09.760 --> 12:13.970
Right, it was written on
the lithograph by the entrance.

12:13.970 --> 12:15.210
Indeed.

12:15.210 --> 12:20.540
That must be trial of bonds
needed to clear the Labyrinth.

12:22.390 --> 12:25.150
To tell apart the impostors...

12:25.150 --> 12:27.870
And to accept the transformed friends.

12:28.370 --> 12:32.310
I think our woven bonds
are being tested here.

12:33.550 --> 12:38.630
That means, there won't be any
problem if I wrap this one up.

12:47.420 --> 12:49.980
Another transport...

12:59.220 --> 13:00.180
Wow!

13:00.180 --> 13:01.140
Hajime!

13:01.140 --> 13:06.450
Master! I do not know how to react
if you hug me so gently!

13:06.450 --> 13:08.460
That's unfair, you two!

13:08.460 --> 13:10.180
Yeah!

13:24.950 --> 13:27.850
Hajime, wake up already!

13:29.360 --> 13:31.000
He won't budge.

13:31.000 --> 13:33.580
Sorry for having you
do this every morning.

13:33.580 --> 13:35.040
Can I leave him to you?

13:41.740 --> 13:43.660
Wake up, Hajime.

13:43.660 --> 13:47.540
If you don't,
I'll sexually assault you.

13:47.920 --> 13:50.190
Yeah, I'm up now.

13:53.840 --> 13:55.690
Morning, Yue.

13:56.190 --> 13:58.340
Morning, Hajime.

14:04.490 --> 14:06.410
Sleeping late again?

14:07.300 --> 14:09.090
Yeah...

14:09.090 --> 14:10.580
Don't sleep too little.

14:12.250 --> 14:13.500
I'll be careful.

14:15.420 --> 14:18.750
Hajime! Yue!

14:19.540 --> 14:21.170
Good morning!

14:21.500 --> 14:23.800
Morning, Shea!

14:23.800 --> 14:25.610
Shea!

14:25.610 --> 14:30.060
I keep telling you not to hug me
every time you greet me!

14:30.060 --> 14:31.230
Hey!

14:31.230 --> 14:36.700
Come on... How could you take away
my happiness, meanie?

14:36.700 --> 14:37.980
Get off me for now!

14:37.980 --> 14:40.780
Yue's eyes are starting to lose their light!

14:40.780 --> 14:45.450
Good grief, I can't believe
two girls have a crush on me...

14:45.860 --> 14:46.700
Huh?

14:47.260 --> 14:50.750
Wait, where did I meet Yue, again?

14:51.230 --> 14:54.060
Has Shea always worn that headband?

14:55.120 --> 14:58.050
Why the long face so early in the morning?

14:58.430 --> 15:01.920
We must go to the classroom
before the bell rings.

15:01.920 --> 15:05.050
The teacher will scold us again.

15:05.050 --> 15:08.750
Classroom... Bell... Teacher...

15:09.190 --> 15:11.210
What's this funny feeling?

15:11.780 --> 15:15.540
They haven't said anything weird, right?

15:15.920 --> 15:19.900
No, I guess it's not the words,
but because they said them?

15:23.850 --> 15:26.320
This feels nostalgic...

15:26.740 --> 15:29.050
Why am I feeling this?

15:29.050 --> 15:31.130
Morning, Hajime.

15:31.130 --> 15:34.660
Cutting it close again today, huh?
You should come earlier next time.

15:34.660 --> 15:37.200
Where have I heard that before?

15:37.840 --> 15:40.030
Damn, what is this?

15:40.030 --> 15:42.960
Why do I feel so awfully nostalgic?

15:42.960 --> 15:44.450
It's just the daily happening...

15:44.800 --> 15:46.340
Something's strange with me today.

15:46.340 --> 15:49.460
Hajime, why are you ignoring me?

15:49.460 --> 15:52.640
Did I do something that made you angry?

15:52.640 --> 15:56.800
Oh, no, I was just deep in thought...

15:56.800 --> 15:58.440
Morning, Shirasaki.

15:58.440 --> 16:00.780
I see. That's great.

16:00.780 --> 16:05.280
Also, didn't I always tell you
to call me Kaori?

16:05.280 --> 16:08.910
Huh? Oh, um, Kaori...

16:08.910 --> 16:11.070
Don't confuse him.

16:11.510 --> 16:13.390
Here comes Yue.

16:14.870 --> 16:17.230
Good morning for you, Yue.

16:17.230 --> 16:17.750
Yeah.

16:18.310 --> 16:21.170
Good morning for you, Kaori.

16:24.060 --> 16:26.580
Wow...

16:29.430 --> 16:33.560
Someone should just subject you
to disciplinary dismissal...

16:37.670 --> 16:39.140
Nice...

16:39.740 --> 16:43.320
Huh? That one was super effective.

16:45.760 --> 16:48.580
Are you taking care of Myu
until Remia is back?

16:48.580 --> 16:49.450
Yeah.

16:49.450 --> 16:50.810
Brother!

16:50.810 --> 16:53.160
Sis Shea and Sis Yue too!

16:56.290 --> 16:57.530
Myu.

16:57.920 --> 17:00.460
Don't run to me.
It's dangerous.

17:06.540 --> 17:10.430
Brother, are you listening to me?

17:10.720 --> 17:13.520
Sorry.

17:13.520 --> 17:15.490
I was spacing out.

17:17.350 --> 17:21.090
Hajime, I can hear someone.

17:21.090 --> 17:22.270
What?

17:22.270 --> 17:23.690
Come on.

17:23.690 --> 17:25.230
Let's have some fun!

17:26.110 --> 17:27.530
Come on!

17:27.900 --> 17:28.900
Come over here.

17:42.320 --> 17:43.290
Right...

17:43.950 --> 17:46.210
I guess Shea wouldn't
have trouble doing that.

17:46.580 --> 17:49.630
Sis Shea, you're so strong! So cool!

17:51.500 --> 17:56.160
When you grow up,
I'll teach you many martial arts.

17:56.160 --> 17:59.330
I'll teach you many things too.

17:59.330 --> 18:00.940
Yay!

18:01.540 --> 18:04.310
Don't teach her weird stuff.

18:07.540 --> 18:10.510
What was I looking for?

18:11.120 --> 18:13.910
Wake... up...

18:18.860 --> 18:21.820
What am I so happy about?

18:22.350 --> 18:23.670
Hajime?

18:24.610 --> 18:27.270
Yue? Come on in.

18:39.990 --> 18:43.290
I have her who loves me to the fullest.

18:43.670 --> 18:46.140
My daily life is already fulfilling.

18:46.800 --> 18:48.010
Who are you?

18:48.010 --> 18:50.820
Who's the voice screaming in my head?

18:51.230 --> 18:54.350
Don't worry about anything.

18:54.350 --> 18:56.860
I'll make you happy, Hajime.

18:56.860 --> 18:57.840
Yue...

18:57.840 --> 19:00.020
Just like you wish for...

19:00.020 --> 19:02.270
I'll always be by your side.

19:03.740 --> 19:05.140
Right...

19:05.650 --> 19:07.220
I have Yue with me.

19:07.660 --> 19:10.110
I don't need anything else.

19:11.110 --> 19:12.540
I don't think I do...

19:13.170 --> 19:16.710
Before me is the ideal life and lover.

19:17.490 --> 19:18.770
That's all I need.

19:20.750 --> 19:24.090
I'll protect Yue,
and Yue will protect me.

19:24.090 --> 19:25.980
That makes us the strongest.

19:26.510 --> 19:29.390
Mow it all down,
and overcome the world.

19:30.660 --> 19:31.690
Right.

19:32.030 --> 19:34.990
This is within the depths of that darkness...

19:36.270 --> 19:38.670
An ideal lover...

19:38.670 --> 19:40.390
A world too kind...

19:41.410 --> 19:42.830
What am I, an idiot?!

19:44.730 --> 19:49.960
I forgot my own vow, and almost
got drowned in the virtual world...

19:49.960 --> 19:52.090
This makes me want to throw up!

19:57.840 --> 20:00.420
Why? I am Yue.

20:00.420 --> 20:03.880
Your ideal lover.

20:03.880 --> 20:05.270
What are you so unhappy about?

20:05.270 --> 20:07.280
Everything, you idiot!

20:07.280 --> 20:12.250
A convenient ideal lover
who always listens to me...

20:12.250 --> 20:14.900
She's just a puppet!

20:14.900 --> 20:17.660
No! I'm not!

20:17.660 --> 20:19.920
I have inherited every personality,

20:19.920 --> 20:22.930
and manifested your ideals.

20:22.930 --> 20:24.060
So please...

20:24.590 --> 20:26.070
How incorrigible.

20:26.620 --> 20:30.240
You're just too off the target,
I'm taking pity on you.

20:31.250 --> 20:32.770
Why?

20:32.770 --> 20:34.960
It's simple.

20:34.960 --> 20:38.680
Nothing should surpass the real Yue.

20:39.390 --> 20:41.090
It goes the same for everyone else.

20:41.440 --> 20:45.720
They're all just a bunch
of uncontrollable rebellious people.

20:46.060 --> 20:51.450
But it's exactly because it's not ideal,
that I can be what I am now.

20:51.450 --> 20:55.750
The ones who tied me to become
what I am now are them.

20:57.270 --> 21:02.750
Don't think some ideal will
be able to replace the real them!

21:02.750 --> 21:04.740
Limit Break!

21:10.810 --> 21:12.370
You passed.

21:12.850 --> 21:15.950
Things that are only kind
are worth nothing.

21:15.950 --> 21:18.510
It won't mean anything
if you only receive.

21:18.510 --> 21:22.330
In hardships and difficulties,
you overlap it with reality,

21:22.330 --> 21:26.640
and what you have woven
will bring you happiness.

21:26.980 --> 21:28.690
Don't you forget that.

21:30.180 --> 21:32.120
That was uncalled for.

21:45.790 --> 21:46.850
Where am I?

21:54.900 --> 21:56.210
What is this?

21:59.540 --> 22:01.410
It's like an amber...

23:33.020 --> 23:35.040
A DEVILISH TRIAL

23:35.040 --> 23:37.630
A DEVILISH TRIAL
Next episode: A Devilish Trial.

23:37.630 --> 23:40.850
A DEVILISH TRIAL
